flowchart TD
  learner[Learner has finished the course]
  record["Course Completion record"]
  gate{Eligible for this version}
  designRequired[Assessment Design Required]
  notEligible[Not Yet Eligible]
  exhausted[Attempts exhausted]
  intro[Opens Get proof 180 Certificate and reads the rules]
  chrome{Google Chrome}
  share{Shares the entire monitor}
  blocked[Attempt does not start]
  inProgress[In Progress]
  stills[JPEG at start then every 5 minutes]
  paused[Share stopped so the attempt pauses]
  submit[Learner submits]
  pending[Pending Review]
  proposal[Demo proposal never issues the certificate]
  reviewer[Reviewer sees answers rubric proposal and stills]
  decision{Written decision}
  issued["Verified proof 180 Certificate"]
  denied["Not Verified / Not Issued"]
  returned[Returned for further review]
  partner[Partner verifies the public ID]

  learner --> record --> gate
  gate -->|no assessment| designRequired
  gate -->|older course version| notEligible
  gate -->|no attempts left| exhausted
  gate -->|owns the matching completion| intro --> chrome
  chrome -->|another browser| blocked
  chrome -->|yes| share
  share -->|dismissed window or tab| blocked
  share -->|entire screen| inProgress --> stills
  inProgress -->|learner stops sharing| paused --> share
  inProgress --> submit --> pending --> proposal --> reviewer --> decision
  decision -->|approve| issued --> partner
  decision -->|reject| denied
  decision -->|return| returned --> reviewer
